[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15480.07, "timestamp": "04:18:00", "text": "上帝就像橘子树一样，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15481.99, "timestamp": "04:18:01", "text": "那个地方有红树之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15485.67, "timestamp": "04:18:05", "text": "朝着那个方向，哦，是的，是的，那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15487.469, "timestamp": "04:18:07", "text": "建筑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15490.389, "timestamp": "04:18:10", "text": "那东西是什么建筑？那里有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15497.67, "timestamp": "04:18:17", "text": "呃，红樱桃树都结束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15501.55, "timestamp": "04:18:21", "text": "这里不是这个，呃，它是和它在一起的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15510.03, "timestamp": "04:18:30", "text": "我不知道那东西在哪儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15512.63, "timestamp": "04:18:32", "text": "没关系，我会找到的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15517.07, "timestamp": "04:18:37", "text": "它和WS一起盛开樱花，是的，这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15519.469, "timestamp": "04:18:39", "text": "这里是我通常的出行路线。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15521.189, "timestamp": "04:18:41", "text": "任务并非"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15525.469, "timestamp": "04:18:45", "text": "这是在某个我不认识的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15528.469, "timestamp": "04:18:48", "text": "嗯，看起来有点像这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15531.189, "timestamp": "04:18:51", "text": "就像"}]